- [Maven pom.xml Explained](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/maven-pom-xml-explained): where starters are declared.
- [Spring Boot Actuator](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/spring-boot-actuator): the health and metrics starter in depth.$sb6$)),
